Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

  * ecadlib/altium_lib.py ports the PcbLib/SchLib binary record layouts
    (primitive common header, track, fill, region and pad records including
    the pad main-block tail template, SchLib pin records, library/section
    stream structure) from AltiumSharp's C# readers and writers. Modified:
    rewritten in Python, reduced to the subset this project writes.
  * ecadlib/assets/pcblib_template.json.gz holds the Library/Data header
    parameters and the FileVersionInfo stream extracted from the AltiumSharp
    TestData file "PCB - LEADLESS - QFN - PSEMI QFN-24 4x4.PcbLib"
    (FILENAME and 2DCONFIGFULLFILENAME blanked).
  * ecadlib/altium_lib.py also ports the through-hole pad hole fields, the arc
    record, the ComponentBody record and parameter order, the Library/Models
    storage and the 3D model checksum (PcbLibWriter.cs, PcbModel.cs).
  * tests/test_kicad_import.py embeds three records from AltiumSharp TestData
    (PAD_TH_SLOT, ARCS_TEST and BODY_3D .PcbLib files) as byte references.

